{"id":"n78928-1-7","stage":1,"title":"짬뽕 · 韩式炒码面","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78928-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 점심엔 새로 생긴 중국집에 중화요리를 시켜 먹자. 넌 뭐 먹을래?","zh":"今天午饭从新开的中餐馆点菜吧，你要吃什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심엔","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중국집에","meaning":"中国餐厅，中华料理店","explanation":"중국집：中国餐厅，中华料理店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중국집","audio":"/audio/51578270f8750bdf6044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26017","senseId":"1","lemma":"중국집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중화요리를","meaning":"中国料理，中式料理","explanation":"중화요리：中国料理，中式料理；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"중화요리","audio":"/audio/3e9f34d94fd3ac31cc5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77240","senseId":"1","lemma":"중화요리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시켜","meaning":"点，叫","explanation":"시키다：点，叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"2","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹자.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을래?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，出现","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"新增了原本没有的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"51578270f8750bdf","term":"중국집","zh":"中国餐厅，中华料理店","audio":"/audio/51578270f8750bdf6044.mp3","entryId":"26017","definition":"制作中国料理的餐厅。","pronunciation":["중국찝"]},{"id":"3e9f34d94fd3ac31","term":"중화요리","zh":"中国料理，中式料理","audio":"/audio/3e9f34d94fd3ac31cc5d.mp3","entryId":"77240","definition":"指中国的料理。","pronunciation":["중화요리"]},{"id":"0258d8fe6108bb9c","term":"시키다","zh":"点，叫","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3","entryId":"29769","definition":"下单购买食物、酒、饮料等。","pronunciation":["시키다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/9bb9787733be3912e5d9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78928-1-7-2","ko":"난 짬뽕으로 할게.","zh":"我要辣海鲜面。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짬뽕으로","meaning":"韩式炒码面，韩式海鲜辣汤面","explanation":"짬뽕：韩式炒码面，韩式海鲜辣汤面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"짬뽕","audio":"/audio/ce5ff89346f987bee851.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78928","senseId":"1","lemma":"짬뽕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할게.","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ce5ff89346f987be","term":"짬뽕","zh":"韩式炒码面，韩式海鲜辣汤面","audio":"/audio/ce5ff89346f987bee851.mp3","entryId":"78928","definition":"将各种海鲜和蔬菜炒熟，并倒入辣汤煮至而成的中式面条。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"吃，喝","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进食或抽烟等。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b72cda89426760ec7465.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.32,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78928","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":1.9734,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天午饭从新开的中餐馆点菜吧，你要吃什么？","我要辣海鲜面。","他为什么放弃拳击了呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天午饭从新开的中餐馆点菜吧，你要吃什么？","我要辣海鲜面。","他为什么放弃拳击了呢？"],"answer":1}]}
